      "id": "I_kwDOSg7Q3M8AAAABCo6W2Q",
      "title": "S/MIME 4+ Requested Changes",
      "url": "https://github.com/lamps-wg/smime-v5/issues/1",
      "state": "OPEN",
      "author": "seanturner",
      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "A list of changes (will use sub-issues to track):\n\n# Technical Changes to Incorporate\n- [ ] Address Falco attack; see #2\n    - [ ] Require signed attributes.\n    - [ ] Also, adopt id-ct-mimeData content type from [-cms-euf-cma-signeddata](https://github.com/lamps-wg/cms-euf-cma-signeddata)?\n\n# Changes to Consider Incorporating\n- [ ] Deprecate EnvelopedData (and AES-CBC)?\n- [ ] Deprecate RSA encryption?\n- [ ] Keep RSA-OAEP?\n- [ ] Add PQ support?\n- [ ] Drop '88 ASN.1 Module?\n\n# Editorial\n- [ ] Pick version\n    - [ ] Change Title and Abbreviation to be \"4+\" until we decide on #\n    - [ ] Incorporate # number throughout\n- [ ] Review and update references, e.g., latest ASN.1, FIPS, ...\n- [ ] Italicize all the field names (now that we're not in the '80s we can use formatting)",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-18T19:47:23Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-29T12:35:54Z",
      "closedAt": null,
      "comments": []
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
