      "body": "There are two ways to address the FALCO attack. Which way do we want to go:\n\n1. Simply always require some signed attributes.\n2. Also, adopt id-ct-mimeData content type from [-cms-euf-cma-signeddata](https://github.com/lamps-wg/cms-euf-cma-signeddata).",
